      "text": "scVI 的输入要求是原始计数数据，模型内部自带归一化过程。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "scVI takes raw count data as input and includes an effective normalization procedure that is integrated into its model."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵只有 log1p 归一化值且没有计数来源，因此不能直接作为 scVI 的输入。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:matrix_state"]
    },
    {
      "text": "scVI 支持批次整合和低维表示，但前提是输入满足原始计数要求。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "scVI stands out from these methods in two important ways... First, it is the only method that explicitly models the two key nuisance factors in scRNA-seq data, namely library size and batch effects."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "批次注释是可选的，模型会在有批次注释时进行条件建模，不会为单批次使用虚构批次标签。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "The distribution is conditioned on the batch annotation bn of each cell (if available), as well as two additional, unobserved random variables."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
